380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (The Random Forest achieved the best overall performance on the test set, outperforming the persistence baseline across all evaluation metrics. In particular, the model reached an F1-score of 0.750, compared with 0.573 for the baseline, while maintaining a very high precision \(0.976\) and a ROC-AUC of 0.910. These results indicate that the model can reliably identify future thermal events while producing very few false alarms. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (The confusion matrix provides a more detailed interpretation of the model's behaviour. Out of 1,027 positive events, the model correctly detected 623, while missing 404. At the same time, it generated only 15 false positives, confirming that the classifier is highly conservative and prioritises precision over recall.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
